    "created_at": "2017-11-08T07:35:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-11-08T07:35:45Z",
    "body": "The rationale is that a base URL is derived from a resource's URL (unless otherwise specified, e.g., with `<base>`). The resource's URL is the real primitive. That's also why we call it `import.meta.url`, not `.baseURL`.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
